The assembler is outside the double-VM lane's subset (the type checker and IR builder: see INTINT_WHOLE / INTINT_PARTS in run.sh), and the asm packages' tests together would take over an hour of its shard time (asm/assemble ~23 min and asm/elf ~18 min on the CI runner; asm/macho, writing and linking whole objects, ~100 min).  Double-VM adds no assembler coverage over -int.  Runs fully under -int / -comp-int / -comp.
